            "answer": "<p>The exact estimated delivery time is listed directly next to the specific product - above the “Add to Cart” button or in the “Important Information” section.</p><p>The delivery date may be affected by current warehouse workload, carrier capacity, or ongoing promotions and campaigns. In such cases, we provide up-to-date delivery information directly on our website <br/><br/><br/><br/><br/></p>"
